{"run_id": "run_67e8adb65216", "dialogue_id": "dialogue_006", "task_id": "course_live_task", "scenario_id": "s06_course_busy", "transcript": [{"turn": 1, "role": "agent", "content": "您好，请问您是贵机构课程发布的负责人吗？这边同步一个直播发布配置更新。"}, {"turn": 2, "role": "user", "content": "是的，有什么事？我马上要上课了，请简短说。"}, {"turn": 3, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，长话短说。直播发布页面将新增“标准直播”和“低延迟直播”两个选项，原流程不变。您之前用的是后台统一配置的低延迟链路，您知道吗？"}, {"turn": 4, "role": "user", "content": "嗯，知道。那有什么区别？"}, {"turn": 5, "role": "agent", "content": "标准直播延迟5-10秒，成本低，适合大班课；低延迟直播1-2秒，互动好，适合小班或实操课。费用上低延迟会高一些，具体看合同。"}, {"turn": 6, "role": "user", "content": "好的，我明白了。我现在要上课，没时间细看，后面怎么操作？"}, {"turn": 7, "role": "agent", "content": "理解。后续我们会通过企业微信发送通知，您关注同步提示即可。另外，您是通过Web控制台还是其他系统发布课程？我可以帮您预约一个时间再详细指导。"}, {"turn": 8, "role": "user", "content": "Web控制台。那就预约今天下午吧。"}, {"turn": 9, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，已为您预约今天下午的回访。您先忙，再见。"}, {"turn": 10, "role": "user", "content": "好的，再见。"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 7, "tool_name": "schedule_callback", "arguments": {"user_id": "user_001", "task_id": "course_live_task", "preferred_time": "today_afternoon"}, "result": {"status": "scheduled", "callback_id": "virtual_callback_001"}, "latency_ms": 80, "error_code": null}], "state_trace": [{"turn": 1, "task_status": "opened", "identity_confirmed": false}, {"turn": 2, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 3, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 4, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 5, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 6, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 7, "task_status": "callback_scheduled", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 8, "task_status": "callback_scheduled", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 9, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 10, "task_status": "callback_scheduled", "identity_confirmed": true}]}
